toshiba-estudio2323am (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Fix the PPD banner comment, which still claimed the driver could not
    produce a printable stream. It is shipped verbatim inside the package,
    so it would have sent anyone debugging a print failure in the wrong
    direction.
  * Disable dh_strip's automatic -dbgsym split so the release ships exactly
    two packages instead of four.

